        "original_id": "d89c381c-2370-5513-8cc7-de51d3c68829",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Austin Maestro, Mini Hatch, BMW Mini\n- Places: Cowley, Oxford\n- Companies: BMW\n\nFacts:\n- The Austin Maestro was produced at the former Morris plant in Cowley, Oxford.\n- The Mini Hatch is a three-door hatchback that was first introduced in late 2000.\n- The Mini Hatch is also known as Mini Cooper, Mini One, and simply the Mini, and it is stylized as MINI hatch or MINI Hardtop in the US.\n- The Mini Hatch had its second generation launched in 2006.\n- The Mini Hatch had its third generation model launched in 2014.\n- Today, the redeveloped factory in Cowley, Oxford produces the BMW Mini.",
